// RowLog — oar / boat motion logger for the ESP32-C3 + BMI160.
//
// The code is in the .cpp and .h files in this folder: start with main.cpp, and change
// settings and pins in rowlog_config.h. The Arduino IDE compiles all of them together
// with this file; it only exists because the IDE needs a <folder name>.ino to open.
//
// Arduino IDE settings: board "ESP32C3 Dev Module", USB CDC On Boot: Enabled,
// Partition Scheme: Default. Library: U8g2 by olikraus (for the OLED).
// PlatformIO users open the "firmware" folder instead; see platformio.ini.
